<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>Investment Services | EPR Access Limited</title>
  <%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="public-body">
  <%- include('../partials/public-nav') %>
  <main>
    <%- include('../partials/flash') %>

    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Our Services</h1>
        <p>A diversified suite of investment and enterprise solutions designed for capital preservation and growth.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Services Overview -->
    <section class="section section-light">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <span class="section-eyebrow">What We Do</span>
          <h2>Our <span class="gradient-text">Services</span></h2>
          <p>A diversified suite of investment and enterprise solutions — one trusted partner for all your financial goals</p>
        </div>
        <div class="services-overview-grid">

          <div class="service-card" id="capital">
            <div class="service-icon">💎</div>
            <h3>Capital Investment</h3>
            <p>Structured wealth management across four tiers — Bronze, Silver, Gold and Diamond — guided by the A-DESIRE standard. Funds are allocated to money market instruments, fixed deposits, bonds and diversified fixed income assets for capital preservation and steady growth.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-card" id="trading">
            <div class="service-icon">📈</div>
            <h3>Trading Market Services</h3>
            <p>Dynamic trading across Forex (major &amp; exotic pairs), stocks &amp; indices, cryptocurrency and USD-denominated assets. Our expert team executes strategies across scalping, swing, position and algorithmic trading for competitive returns.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-card" id="money-market">
            <div class="service-icon">💵</div>
            <h3>Money Market Services</h3>
            <p>Short-term investments with flexible options and attractive returns. Efficient liquidity management, cash flow optimisation and expert treasury services for individuals and businesses — designed for security, liquidity and growth.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-card" id="savings">
            <div class="service-icon">🐷</div>
            <h3>Savings Plan – Save Future</h3>
            <p>Disciplined savings with fixed contributions toward a specific financial goal. Funds earn competitive returns in low-risk instruments. Flexible tenures match your income and cash flow — withdraw any time, any day.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-card" id="fixed-deposit">
            <div class="service-icon">🏦</div>
            <h3>Fixed Deposit</h3>
            <p>Place funds for a set period at a pre-agreed interest rate. Your principal is secure, returns are fixed at inception and tenors range from 30 days to several years. Unaffected by market swings — ideal for conservative investors.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-card" id="real-estate">
            <div class="service-icon">🏢</div>
            <h3>Real Estate Management</h3>
            <p>Comprehensive real estate solutions: property sales, acquisition, construction, valuation and estate management. We navigate Nigeria's $56B real estate market with rigorous due diligence, transparent transactions and long-term value creation.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-card" id="it">
            <div class="service-icon">💻</div>
            <h3>IT Services</h3>
            <p>Technology solutions for business growth: custom software, website development, data analytics, hardware supply, integrated systems solutions and cybersecurity — protecting your digital assets with top-tier security.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-card" id="farming">
            <div class="service-icon">🌾</div>
            <h3>Farming Services</h3>
            <p>Agricultural investments powered by modern techniques. High-yield crop farming (maize, rice, cassava, palm oil, cocoa), livestock production, agro-tech solutions and agro-chemicals. Sustainability, profitability and food security for our partners.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-card" id="livestock">
            <div class="service-icon">🐄</div>
            <h3>Livestock Market Services</h3>
            <p>Lucrative livestock investment opportunities — cattle farming with assured returns, poultry production and sales, and livestock trading with access to local and international markets. Transparency, animal welfare and profitable outcomes guaranteed.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-card" id="project">
            <div class="service-icon">🤝</div>
            <h3>Project Financing</h3>
            <p>Tailored project financing to fuel growth — flexible capital for business expansion or new ventures, expert guidance for project success and competitive rates to boost your ROI. Smart financing that drives your projects forward.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-card" id="portfolio-management">
            <div class="service-icon">📋</div>
            <h3>Portfolio Management</h3>
            <p>EPR Access Limited provides professional portfolio management services designed to preserve capital, optimize returns, and align investments with each client's financial goals and risk appetite. Our approach combines rigorous market research, data-driven asset allocation, and active risk management. We construct and monitor diversified portfolios across key asset classes including fixed income, equities, money market instruments, and alternative investments.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Investment Detail Section -->
    <section class="section section-dark" id="investment-detail">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <span class="section-eyebrow">Investment</span>
          <h2>Structured <span class="gradient-text">Investment Products</span></h2>
          <p>EPR Access Investment — designed to help individuals and businesses grow and preserve capital through disciplined, low-to-moderate risk strategies</p>
        </div>
        <div class="investment-detail-grid">

          <div class="inv-detail-card" id="savings-plan">
            <div class="inv-detail-badge savings">Savings Plan</div>
            <h3>Save Future – My Savings Plan</h3>
            <p>A structured approach to setting aside money regularly toward a specific financial goal. Unlike ad-hoc saving, it involves fixed contributions over a set period, with interest or investment growth applied to build capital steadily.</p>
            <ul class="inv-features">
              <li><strong>Discipline:</strong> Automates consistent saving, reducing the temptation to spend.</li>
              <li><strong>Goal alignment:</strong> Tailored for short to medium-term objectives — education, travel, business capital or emergency funds.</li>
              <li><strong>Growth potential:</strong> Funds placed in low-risk money market or fixed deposit instruments to earn returns while preserving capital.</li>
              <li><strong>Flexibility:</strong> Adjustable contributions and tenors to match income and cash flow. Withdraw any time, any day.</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-gold">Start Saving</a>
          </div>

          <div class="inv-detail-card" id="fixed-deposit-plan">
            <div class="inv-detail-badge fixed">Fixed Deposit</div>
            <h3>Fixed Deposit – Stop Unnecessary Spending</h3>
            <p>A low-risk investment where you place funds for a set period at a pre-agreed interest rate. You receive predictable returns — capital is preserved and returns are fixed at inception.</p>
            <ul class="inv-features">
              <li><strong>Capital preservation:</strong> Your principal is secure, making it suitable for conservative investors.</li>
              <li><strong>Fixed returns:</strong> Interest rate locked at inception — you know exactly what you'll earn.</li>
              <li><strong>Tenor flexibility:</strong> 30 days to several years — match it to your cash flow needs.</li>
              <li><strong>Low volatility:</strong> Not affected by market swings, unlike stocks or crypto.</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-gold">Open Fixed Deposit</a>
          </div>

          <div class="inv-detail-card" id="trading-inv">
            <div class="inv-detail-badge trading">Trading</div>
            <h3>Trading Investment – Earn Faster</h3>
            <p>Dynamic profit-sharing trading investment. Your capital is actively managed across multiple strategies and asset classes by our expert team.</p>
            <div class="trading-categories">
              <div class="trade-cat">
                <h4>By Asset Class</h4>
                <ul>
                  <li>Stock Trading — publicly listed companies</li>
                  <li>Forex Trading — USD/NGN, EUR/USD and more</li>
                  <li>Commodities — gold, oil, agricultural products</li>
                  <li>Cryptocurrency — Bitcoin, Ethereum and leading digital assets</li>
                  <li>Bond Trading — government and corporate debt</li>
                  <li>Derivatives — futures, options, CFDs</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="trade-cat">
                <h4>By Strategy</h4>
                <ul>
                  <li>Technical Trading — charts and price indicators</li>
                  <li>Fundamental Trading — earnings, economic data</li>
                  <li>Algorithmic Trading — automated rule-based systems</li>
                  <li>Arbitrage Trading — cross-market price differences</li>
                  <li>News Trading — economic releases and events</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-gold">Start Trading</a>
          </div>

          <div class="inv-detail-card" id="dollar">
            <div class="inv-detail-badge dollar">Dollar Investment</div>
            <h3>Dollar Investment – Foreign Currency</h3>
            <p>Place capital in USD-denominated assets to protect against naira devaluation and generate returns in a stable currency. Options include US dollar money market funds, Eurobonds, offshore equities and USD-denominated fixed income instruments.</p>
            <ul class="inv-features">
              <li><strong>Currency hedge:</strong> Preserve purchasing power against naira volatility.</li>
              <li><strong>Global access:</strong> Diversification outside domestic risk with access to international markets.</li>
              <li><strong>Stability:</strong> Returns denominated in USD provide long-term wealth preservation.</li>
              <li><strong>Minimum entry:</strong> From $50 — accessible to every investor.</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-gold">Invest in Dollars</a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-dark">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <span class="section-eyebrow">Getting Started</span>
          <h2>How It <span class="gradient-text">Works</span></h2>
          <p>Turn your financial goals into measurable results in four simple steps</p>
        </div>
        <div class="steps-grid stagger">
          <div class="step-card">
            <div class="step-num">01</div>
            <h3>Create Your Account</h3>
            <p>Register in minutes to join our platform. Once verified, log in to access all features from one secure dashboard.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step-card">
            <div class="step-num">02</div>
            <h3>Fund Your Wallet</h3>
            <p>Deposit via bank transfer or card payment through Squad by GTBank — fast, secure and convenient.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step-card">
            <div class="step-num">03</div>
            <h3>Choose an Investment Plan</h3>
            <p>Select from a range of plans for different goals and risk profiles, with clear guidance from our team.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step-card">
            <div class="step-num">04</div>
            <h3>Monitor Performance</h3>
            <p>Track your portfolio, contributions and returns in real time. Stay informed and in control at every step.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
  <%- include('../partials/public-footer') %>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
